# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research-only artifacts: kept locally for paper reproducibility but NOT
# tracked in the publication-facing branch. End users only need the
# `lobster_generate` / `lobster_autoencode` inference surface; the items
# below are training launchers, ablation sweeps, and exploratory notes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Multi-node distributed generation pipeline (research-only; the
# single-machine inference path is `lobster_generate`).
